# Moderation steps go to QA

The agent has no access to the moderation portal. When a scenario depends on moderation of a word, a collection, or a user, ask QA to perform the parts that require it. Those parts stay unperformed until QA has done them.

Continue the scenario from what QA reports and from behavior that is visible on the environment under test.
